ttery on the course.<br><br>TERMS OF SERVICE<br>https://18birdies.com/legal/terms<br><br>GOOGLE MAPS TERMS &amp; PRIVACY<br>https://www.google.com/policies/terms<br>https://www.google.com/policies/privacy",
